  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 — PDF/A-2b now embeds all fonts automatically, including the default font-less path (a small OFL font is bundled), so archival output is conformant out of the box; watermarks and form fields under PDF/A now fail fast with a clear error instead of emitting a non-conformant file. Zero-dependency, pure-.NET HTML-to-PDF: modern CSS (flexbox, grid, gradients, transforms), SVG, PDF/A-2b and PDF/UA-1, RC4-128/AES-256 encryption, and right-to-left scripts (Arabic with GSUB cursive joining + GPOS harakat, and Hebrew).",
